  "_comment": "Golden table for the push item derivation (W13-30): Mother jobs on a host and the items they make waiting on the operator. One item per awaiting or held job (not a quota pause), plus one per unacknowledged attention reason of progress_stalled, burn_ahead or gates_incomplete. The same rules are the MotherNeedsYouProducer's (MC4), so a change to this file is a change to both. Item names: item=mother has a reason of asked | blocked_after_review | held_after_failure | spend_cap | pipeline_blocked | needs_you, a job_ref (the 8-hex suffix of the id, or null), a repo and owner (from the job's pr_url only, else null) and a start (paused_at, or null); item=attention has the reason and its since. No free-text field (title, question, plan, branch, notes, repo) is read.",
